==rebase
rebase feature branch on top of main: jj rebase -b my-feature -d main
reorder commits: jj arrange
move commit 'abc' so it sits before 'xyz': jj rebase -r abc -B xyz
move range of commits ('abc' to 'def') to sit after commit 'xyz': jj rebase -r "abc::def" -A xyz
* git iff abc::def represent entire tip of branch and to move on top of xyz:
  git rebase --onto xyz abc~1

==autofix/auosquash
automatic squash into historical commits originally altered those lines: jj absorb

==squashing
squash working copy into parent: jj squash
interactively select changes from current commit into its parent: jj squash -i
move only specific file into parent commit: jj squash file.txt
squash commit into different commit: jj squash --from abc --into xyz
squash commit into own parent: jj squash -r abc
* git commit --amend --no-edit
* git rebase -i abc~2

